---
import InfoLayout from '../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
---
<InfoLayout
  path="/privacy"
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="RateKit privacy policy. Learn how we collect, use and protect your data."
  pageTag="Legal"
  h1="Privacy Policy"
  pageSub="How RateKit collects, uses, and protects your data."
  breadcrumbLabel="Privacy"
>
  <p class="last-updated">Last updated: April 28, 2026</p>

  <div class="highlight-box">
    <strong>Short version:</strong> RateKit calculators work entirely in your browser. We do not store your calculation inputs or results. The only data we collect is standard analytics (page views, clicks) via Google Analytics.
  </div>

  <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
  <p>RateKit ("we", "us", "our") is a free web service available at <a href="https://ratekit.org">ratekit.org</a> providing business calculators for founders, freelancers and entrepreneurs. The service is operated by an individual developer.</p>
  <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:connect4fund@gmail.com">connect4fund@gmail.com</a></p>

  <h2>2. Data We Collect</h2>
  <h3>2.1 Calculator Data</h3>
  <p>All calculations on RateKit happen entirely in your browser (client-side JavaScript). <strong>We do not transmit, store, or process any numbers you enter into our calculators.</strong> Your financial data never leaves your device.</p>

  <h3>2.2 Analytics Data (Google Analytics 4)</h3>
  <p>We use Google Analytics 4 to understand how visitors use our site. This includes:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Pages visited and time spent</li>
    <li>Approximate geographic location (country/city level)</li>
    <li>Device type, browser and operating system</li>
    <li>Referral source (how you found us)</li>
    <li>Interactions with calculator elements</li>
  </ul>
  <p>This data is aggregated and anonymised. We cannot identify individual users from this data. Google Analytics may use cookies — see our <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a> for details.</p>

  <h3>2.3 Future: User Accounts (Coming Soon)</h3>
  <p>We plan to introduce optional user accounts for saving calculations. If you choose to register, we will collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Email address</li>
    <li>Password (stored as a secure hash — we never see your actual password)</li>
    <li>Saved calculation data you explicitly choose to store</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Registration will always be optional. All core calculator functionality will remain free and available without an account.</p>

  <h2>3. Legal Basis for Processing (GDPR)</h2>
  <p>For users in the European Economic Area (EEA), we process data under the following legal bases:</p>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Data Type</th><th>Legal Basis</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Analytics data</td><td>Legitimate interest (improving our service)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Account data (future)</td><td>Performance of a contract / Consent</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2>4. Data Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your data. We share data only with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — for site analytics (Google LLC, USA). Governed by Google's Privacy Policy.</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — our hosting provider processes request logs for security and performance.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>Analytics data is retained for 14 months in Google Analytics (default setting). We do not retain calculator input data as it is never transmitted to our servers.</p>

  <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
    <li>Request correction or deletion of your data</li>
    <li>Object to processing or request restriction</li>
    <li>Data portability</li>
    <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:connect4fund@gmail.com">connect4fund@gmail.com</a>. We will respond within 30 days.</p>

  <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
  <p>We use cookies for analytics purposes only. See our <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a> for full details.</p>

  <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>RateKit is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect data from children.</p>

  <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. We will notify users of significant changes by updating the date at the top of this page.</p>

  <h2>10. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy? Email us at <a href="mailto:connect4fund@gmail.com">connect4fund@gmail.com</a>.</p>
</InfoLayout>
